<title>PERU: Peruvian brewery CNC 11-mo net falls.</title>
<headline>Peruvian brewery CNC 11-mo net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ending Novemeber 30.</p>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 8.1 million soles vs 20.3 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 172.0 million soles vs 177.1 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania Nacional de Cerveza (CNC) is Peru's third largest brewery and belongs to the Backus group.</p>
<p>The group's shareholders merged December 30 CNC with its three sister companies Cerveceria Backus y Johnston SA, Sociedad Cervecera de Trujillo SA and Cerveceria del Norte SA.</p>
<p>Backus y Johnston published its January to November financial results earlier Thursday.</p>
<p>((Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
